@@ -1,5 +1,15 @@
 # History learnings
 
+## Readable history exposes authoritative task evidence identities
+
+The simplified history text omitted stored message and run identities, leaving a coordinator
+unable to bind an execution Todo to a real child run or cite its answer without guessing.
+`read_agent_history` now returns optional typed `message_refs` from only the readable messages
+that fit its selected page, after the existing target permission and query filters. References
+and readable text share the existing 80,000-character budget. Configuration-only records expose
+no reference; a run-less message omits `run_id`. A reference establishes identity only, never
+successful completion or coordinator verification, which the Todo module still validates.
+
 ## Activity reads lifecycle metadata without transcript pages
 
 An idle child does not prove successful completion, and reading its whole last run to discover
